dhi-Lālasā"}}},"song":{"meta":{"page":138,"first_line":"gāy gorā madhur svare","author":"Śrīla Bhakti Vinod Ṭhākur"},"title":["Śrī Nāma"],"author":["by Śrīla Bhakti Vinod Ṭhākur"],"verses":[{"number":"1","text":["    gāy gorā madhur svare","hare kṛṣṇa hare kṛṣṇa, kṛṣṇa kṛṣṇa hare hare","hare rāma hare rāma, rāma rāma hare hare"],"translation":["Lord Gaurasundar sings in a very sweet voice, “Hare Krishna, Hare Krishna, Krishna Krishna, Hare Hare, Hare Rāma, Hare Rāma, Rāma Rāma, Hare Hare.”"],"isLong":false},{"number":"2","text":["gṛhe thāko, vane thāko, sadā ‘hari’ bole’ ḍāko,","sukhe duḥkhe bhulo nāko, vadane harinām kara re"],"translation":["Whether you live at home or in the forest always chant the Lord’s Holy Name; in happiness or sadness, don’t forget — chant the Holy Name and fill your lips with *Harinām*."],"isLong":false},{"number":"3","text":["māyā-jāle baddha ho’ye, ācho miche kāja lo’ye,","ekhona o chetana peye, rādhā-mādhava-nām bolo re"],"translation":["Bound in *māyā’s* net you’ve slaved and toiled in vain. But now that you have a human life and consciousness, chant the Lord’s Name, “Rādhā-Mādhava.”"],"isLong":false},{"number":"4","text":["jīvana hoilo śeṣa, nā bhajile hṛṣīkeśa","bhaktivinod-upadeśa, ekbār nām-rase māto re"],"translation":["This life must surely end soon, and you have not worshiped Hṛṣīkeśa, the master of the senses. Bhakti Vinod advises: at least once, taste the *nāma-rasa*, the nectar of the Holy Name."],"isLong":false}],"resources":{"audio":[{"title":"Srila B.S. Govinda Dev-Goswami Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/govinda-maharaj-gay-gora","personSlug":"srila-b-s-govinda-dev-goswami-maharaj"},{"title":"Srila B.B. Avadhut Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/avadxut-maxaradzh-gaj-goura-1","personSlug":"srila-b-b-avadhut-maharaj"},{"title":"Srila B.B. Avadhut Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/avadxut-maxaradzh-gaj-goura","personSlug":"srila-b-b-avadhut-maharaj"},{"title":"Srila B.S. Goswami Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/goswami-maharaj-gay-gora-1","personSlug":"srila-b-s-goswami-maharaj"},{"title":"Srila B.S. Goswami Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/goswami-maharaj-gay-gora","personSlug":"srila-b-s-goswami-maharaj"},{"title":"Manasa Krishna Prabhu","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/huron/gay-gaura-madhura-sware","personSlug":"manasa-krishna-prabhu"},{"title":"Caracas temple","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/shchsm-karakas-gai-gora-madxur","personSlug":"caracas-temple"}]},"hasWbw":false,"hasVersesText":true,"hasVersesTranslations":true,"hasLongVerses":false,"fullInlineWbw":false},"telegraphUrl":null},"head":{"canonical":"/en-2022/gay-gora-madhur-svare/","description":"Śrī Nāma — a Vaiṣṇava song by Śrīla Bhakti Vinod Ṭhākur with lyrics, English translation and word-by-word meaning. From Kirtan Guide.","title":"Śrī Nāma. by Śrīla Bhakti Vinod Ṭhākur | Kirtan Site"},"kind":"song","route":{"kind":"item","bookId":"en-2022","slug":"gay-gora-madhur-svare"}}